# first power-on: it plays at once; Clock mode asks the time, starting at the time saved (9:00 the first time),
# and the music meanwhile is the morning's; 20 s untouched and the clock screen confirms itself
wav first.wav
wait 300
expect playing 1
expect setting 1
expect clock 0
expect min 540
expect phase 3
expect day 1
expect par18 72
expect par19 7
expect par20 0
shot setclock.png
wait 21000
expect setting 0
expect view 0
shot coast.png
wait 40000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -30
# the screen reader: the coast in words
listen
wait 100
said 09:01, Morning. Calm, tide rising. Day 1. Abel is mending nets
